        "name": "discover.rs",
        "summary": "Implements `POST /api/models/discover`: derives candidate /v1/models URLs from a provider base, performs multi-candidate HTTP fallback with protocol-correct headers, and parses/dedupes/sorts model ids.",
        "code_purpose": "specificfeature",
        "source_summary": "Defines DiscoverRequest/DiscoveredModel/DiscoverResponse/ResolvedProvider types and helpers primary_models_url, candidate_urls, parse_discovered_models, collect_items, truncate, natcmp, default_api, with an extensive test suite covering base-with/without-v1, anthropic path insertion, fallback dedupe, and auth headers.",
        "detailed_description": "Contains pure, unit-tested helpers for URL derivation (OpenAI vs Anthropic path rules, v1 insertion, suffix stripping) and header construction (bearer vs anthropic), plus a multi-shape response parser that extracts model ids from varied provider payloads. Candidate URLs are deduped preserving order, results are naturally sorted, and strings are truncated for safe display.",
